OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we know about RAF Fairford
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of explosive and terrorism
OL,8,Foffences after a major incident was
OL,9,Fdeclared at an RAF airbase in the west
OL,10,Fof England.
OL,12,FThree vans were spotted near RAF
OL,13,FFairford and the police were called,
OL,14,Fbefore a huge operation in
OL,15,FGloucestershire saw the area put under
OL,16,Fcordon on Sunday morning.
OL,18,FOn Monday Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,19,Fsaid the suspects were all UK nationals
OL,20,Fin their 20s.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
